quic.zig, entity.zig and entity-tool.zig are the Reflect QUIC stack, the
entity key and name code, and the `entity name <key-file>` tool from
WorldTreeNetwork/homoiconic commit 3122521938cc8c953b0915eb0a52740af8a836f3
(unikernel/quic.zig, unikernel/entity.zig, unikernel/entity-tool.zig),
copied unmodified. quic.zig at that commit answers a Retry (homoiconic
add-quic-admission, 695ce77); entity.zig and entity-tool.zig are unchanged
since e9a4c86.
host.zig is the Mjolnir host client written against that stack, after
homoiconic's unikernel/quic-client.zig. It needs no change for a Retry:
Conn.recv takes it.
The homoiconic tree is not modified.

Build (Zig 0.16.0, Linux), from the repository root:

  bash scripts/build-reflect-quic.sh

which writes priv/reflect-quic-client and priv/reflect-entity. Deploy runs
it from scripts/build-release.sh before `mix release`.
